uptime - System uptime and load averages
htop (or top) - Real-time CPU and process activity
free -h - Memory (RAM) and Swap usage
df -h - Disk storage capacity across partitions
du -sh /* 2>/dev/null | sort -hr | head -n 10 - Top 10 largest root directories
systemctl --failed - Failed systemd services
journalctl -p 3 -xb - High-priority system error logs
apt list --upgradable - Available package updates
ss -tulpn - Active listening ports and sockets
lsb_release -a & uname -r - OS release and kernel version


